<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister shall appoint a Chief Executive Officer of the Institute and such numbers of Deputy Chief Executive Officers on such terms and conditions as the Minister may determine."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
