<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chief Executive Officer shall be responsible for the overall administration and management of the functions and the day-to-day affairs of the Institute."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_18> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
