<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chief Executive Officer shall perform such further duties as the Minister may from time to time direct."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_18> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
