<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "In discharging his duties, the Chief Executive Officer shall act under the general authority and direction of the Institute."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_18> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
