<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "If the Chief Executive Officer is temporarily absent from Malaysia or is temporarily incapacitated through illness or for any other reason from performing of his duties, or if the office of the Chief Executive Officer is for the time being vacant, the Institute may direct any Deputy Chief Executive Officer to perform the duties of the Chief Executive Officer during such temporary absence or incapacity. Employment of other officers and employees of the Institute"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
