<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_19__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "No person shall be eligible for employment as an officer or employee of the Institute if he has, directly or indirectly, by himself or through his partner, any share or interest in any contract or proposed contract with, for or on behalf of the Institute."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_19__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_19> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
