<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_19__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Institute may, with the approval of the Minister, make regulations with respect to the conditions of service of its officers and employees."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
