<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_II__cl_17__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Institute may elect any of its members or any other person to be the chairman of a committee established under subsection (1)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
