<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_II__cl_17__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "A committee may regulate its own procedure and, in the exercise of its powers under this subsection, such committee shall be subject to and act in accordance with any direction given to the committee by the Institute."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
