<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_I__cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "“sportsperson” has the same meaning assigned to it by the Sports Development Act 1997 [Act 576]; “athlete” means a sportsperson who receives training and competes in sports competitions or events; “potential athlete” means a sportsperson who has excellent physical capacity according to age and is capable of mastering locomotor skills and able to accept emotional intelligence learning processes well and possess a strong competitive spirit; “sports body” has the same meaning assigned to it by the Sports Development Act 1997; “Government entity” means—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
