<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Before 1 September of each year, the Institute shall submit to the Minister an estimate of the expenditure, including the expenditure for research and development activities, for the following year in such form and containing such particulars as the Minister may direct."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
