<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_V__cl_26__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The property in every research finding undertaken by the Institute that is funded entirely by grants made to the Institute by any Government entity shall vest in the Institute."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_V__cl_26__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~part_V__cl_26> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
