<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~sched_1__para_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
