<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~sched_1__para_2__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Institute may invite any person to attend a meeting or deliberation of the Institute for the purpose of advising it on any matter under discussion but that person shall not be entitled to vote at the meeting or deliberation."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
