<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~sched_1__para_2__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A person invited under subparagraph (1) may be paid such allowances and other expenses as the Institute may determine. Disclosure of interest"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
