<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@/~sched_1__para_3> <https://schema.org/text> "A member of the Institute having, directly or indirectly, by himself or his partner, any interest in any company or undertaking with which the Institute proposes to make any contract or having any interest in any such contract or in any matter under discussion by the Institute shall disclose to the Institute the fact and nature of his interest, and such disclosure shall be recorded in the minutes of the Institute and, unless specifically authorized by the Chairman, such member shall take no part in any deliberation or decision of the Institute relating to the contract or matter. Minutes"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/3/eng@> .
